The first 8-step tape is slower than the earlier cached 5-step builds, consistent with the current load average near 15 and niceness 15. This preparation remains outside the selector stopwatch and will be disclosed separately.
diff --git a/harness/selector_latency.py b/harness/selector_latency.py
