+
+`Ctx miss` is the fraction of legal catalogue rows for which `contexts.get(...) is None`. `Other` is the explicitly measured eligibility filter + stable argmax + commit bookkeeping + unassigned wrapper overhead; its components remain separate in the receipt and distribution table.
