+| Unassigned benchmark-wrapper overhead | 0.014 | 0.015 | 0.017 | 0.019 | 0.024 | 0.017 |
+| Decision through stable argmax | 5.271 | 9.323 | **11.532** | 17.128 | **22.018** | 13.033 |
+| **Presentation to evaluated commit** | **5.457** | **9.596** | **12.014** | **19.077** | **24.079** | **13.977** |
+
+The combined head-forward row is the per-anchor sum before taking quantiles; it is not the sum of separately reported quantiles. “Unassigned” is the measured gap between the sum of all explicit stage stopwatches and the outer end-to-end stopwatch.
+
